Hi {Owner},

I build websites for caterers around {City}. {Business Name} clearly does beautiful events, but there's nowhere a couple or an office manager can check a date, see a starting price or book a tasting.

I built a sample first rather than ask for your time: a date check, sample menus by service style with per-person starting prices you set, a tasting booking step and an office lunch order page, with marked placeholders where your photos would go:

{demo-link}

If you want it, I move it to a domain you own and finish it for {Build Range}, plus {Care Range} a month for hosting and menu updates. If not, no problem, it comes down at the end of the month.

Worth fifteen minutes before prep one morning?

